5 - Files
    -----

    L002_00_Premises.v

      Core mirror and recognition vocabulary plus optional interfaces.

    L002_01__Mirror_Unrefutability.v

      Goal-frame construction, fixed-point collapse, mirror irrefutability,
      coded recognition exclusion, and relative-consistency corollaries.

    L002_02__Recursive_Mirror_Lemma.v

      Finite mirror iteration and optional response-trace classification.

    L002_03__Symbolic_Regulation.v

      Finite-state recurrence, attribution, provenance observations, and
      conditional externalization.

    L002_95_API.v

      Stable contracts.

    L002_97_Artifacts.v

      Certified endpoints and assumption reports.

    L002_98_Sanity.v

      Compile-time probes of the public surface.


6 - API
    ---

    Import the API with:

      From L002 Require Import L002_95_API.

    Core mirror:

      L002_CORE_CONTRACT, CORE_WITNESS
      AsIF
      ExternalFixedPoint
      ExternalMirrorPosition
      MirrorConsistent
      MirrorLocallyConsistent
      l001_goal_frame_constructs_external_fixed_point
      external_fixed_point_unconditionally_collapses
      external_mirror_position_forces_asif_local
      external_mirror_position_forces_asif

    Recognition:

      CodedRecognitionClaim
      CodedRecognitionCertificate
      CodedRecognitionAccepted
      coded_recognition_acceptance_iff_evidence
      coded_recognition_acceptance_excluded_local
      coded_recognition_acceptance_excluded

    Recursive core:

      recursive_mirror_formula
      RecursiveMirrorAdequacy
