    Certified endpoints:

      l002_core_qed
      mirror_lemma_qed
      recursive_mirror_lemma_qed
      symbolic_regulation_qed

    `l002_core_qed` is primary. `symbolic_regulation_qed` retains the legacy
    broad bundle. Assumption reports are redirected under
    `_appendix/_assumptions`.


7 - Notes
    -----

    `External` means metatheoretically supplied. In particular, the one-way
    mirror is not produced by the collapsing L001 full-fixed-point theorem.

    `MirrorLocallyConsistent` is the formula-local consistency premise used by
    the core proofs. `MirrorConsistent` is stronger and supplies the legacy
    global forms.

    Recursive formulas are finite iterates. Response constructors are tags,
    and attribution labels are formal codings. L002 establishes no
    interpretation beyond the declared interfaces.

    `CORE_WITNESS` is the primary theorem-core endpoint. The legacy `WITNESS`
    preserves a parallel broad contract; it is not definitionally the core
    conjoined with optional interfaces.

    Assumption reports are redirected under `_appendix/_assumptions/`.
